 ## Overview
-Depth Completion Network NeRF integrates a guided depth completion network into the NeRF training loop to recover dense depth maps from sparse LiDAR measurements using image guidance for higher accuracy [S2]. Unlike sibling methods that rely on monocular depth estimation (MDE) priors which lack absolute scale or suffer from accuracy compromises, this method uses LiDAR-based completion to provide dense, metrically consistent depth supervision [S2]. It sets itself apart by explicitly addressing the sparsity of raw LiDAR data through guided completion, making it suitable for unbounded real-world scenes where raw LiDAR is insufficient [S2].
